      <h3 id="admin-views">Admin views and funding workflows</h3>
      <p>Queues · Payments · Feedback · Export</p>
      <p>Built with Karma</p>
      <p>
        Built in partnership with Karma, the <strong>admin view</strong> is the centerpiece
        for the team running the program. Reviews and payment items queue up by priority
        and age, so it is always clear what to pick up next. Feedback from reviewers
        and funded teams in selected Telegram and Slack channels, along with Simocracy
        feedback, is integrated automatically into those same work items. The aim
        is better turnaround times and a better experience for every stakeholder,
        with AI making the ops side of reviews lightweight.
      </p>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-tint p-6">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE TEAM</p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://www.karmahq.org/">Karma</a> is an AI-powered funding platform
          that foundations and ecosystems use to run funding programs from application
          to outcome. As our platform partner, Karma is building filpgf.io alongside
          our team and holds the program’s records, bringing together metrics and
          sim reviews. For Filecoin, it handles intake and review workflows, onboarding
          tasks like document signing and KYB tracking, invoice tracking, and payment
          disbursements. Karma is also a headless platform, so all program data can
          be accessed through MCP and Agent Skills as well as the web app.
        </p>
      </div>

